+## Follow-up: owner still cannot see the mobile specimen
+The previous portal-based repair failed the owner's phone check. Remove it rather than mark it successful. The lab now renders one unconditional navigation specimen in normal document flow at every viewport. Route-scoped CSS overrides inherited fixed positioning and translation on the specimen only. On mobile it remains a five-column row; on desktop it retains the vertical layout. L42 is a visible lab marker to distinguish this revision. This deliberately tests the component inside the workbench, not the production Dock's viewport anchoring. The original cause is not established; fresh phone visibility/touch confirmation remains required.
